OL,3,GNEWSAM20 crash scene like a horror
OL,4,Amovie, passenger says
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman who narrowly avoided being
OL,7,Finvolved in a 30-car crash on the M20
OL,8,Fhas said the aftermath of the incident
OL,9,Fwas "like a horror movie" amid thick
OL,10,Ffog.
OL,12,FAlena Borodina and her husband narrowly
OL,13,Favoided the crash on Saturday evening
OL,14,Fby swerving out of the way of cars
OL,15,Fstopped in front of them, and avoiding
OL,16,Florries struggling to come to a halt
OL,17,Fbehind them.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,322,320,200,140,0,100
