OL,3,GNEWSAM20 crash scene like a horror
OL,4,Amovie, passenger says
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo people were seriously injured in
OL,7,Fthe crash heading towards London
OL,8,Fbetween Maidstone and Ashford, which
OL,9,Ftook place just after 18:40 GMT,
OL,10,Faccording to Kent Police.
OL,12,FBorodina, from Aylesford, said: "We
OL,13,Fwere really terrified that someone
OL,14,Fwould crash into the back of us."
